cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or these model weights, please cite the source dataset as well."
title: "Chest X-ray lesion detection (NIH ChestX-ray14)"
abstract: >-
  RF-DETR-S and D-FINE-S fine-tuned for 8-class lesion localisation on chest radiographs,
  trained on the box-annotated subset of NIH ChestX-ray14, with an in-browser demo that runs
  the exported ONNX locally via onnxruntime-web. Research use only - not a medical device.
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-24"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/kcheung-inno/chestxray14-lesion-detector"
url: "https://kcheung-inno.github.io/chestxray14-lesion-detector/"
authors:
